istic analysis of Troncoso’s own letter and songs, that Troncoso had in fact written the lyrics; the Dominican Academy of Sciences responded on 8 February 2026 by formally reaffirming Solano as the song’s sole author."}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', id, 1 FROM artists WHERE slug = 'manuel-troncoso'
